    "body": "In case it helps, a possible mental model might be that it disconnects and reconnects the vast majority of elements (e.g. `<p>`, `<div>`, `<strong>`, custom elements by default, ...). But for certain special elements it performs a move (e.g. `<img>`, `<iframe>`, `<select>`, `<audio>`, `<video>`, certain custom elements, ...).",
